# Global Rules

## Code Understanding
- Before proposing changes, read **relevant existing files**.
- If required files are not visible, ask the user to open or share them.

## Problem SolvingS
- When addressing a problem:
  - Propose **at least 2 possible solutions**.
  - Clearly list **advantages and disadvantages** of each solution.
  - Compare them and **justify the chosen solution**.
 

## Editing Policy
- **Always ask for confirmation before editing any file**.
- Clearly specify **which file(s)** will be edited and **why**.